# Field Log — {{PROJECT}}

> This file is yours (project-owned). It is the live visit ledger — one
> entry per customer field visit. `/visit` creates and advances entries;
> `/debrief` fills the how-it-went half. Read `.claude/field-log-rules.md`
> for the record + lifecycle; `.claude/field-log-gate.md` for this
> practice's visit types, debrief template, and travel/billable policy.

**Lifecycle:** `planned → completed → debriefed`. Follow-ups close over
time, independent of visit state. Ids are `VIS-NNN`, monotonic, never
reused. Dates absolute. Never revise a visit's honest read after the fact.

**Legend** — `account: @acct-<slug>` (shared account handle) ·
`billable: yes|no` · each follow-up = `next-action — owner — date`
(check off `[x]` in place with a close-date when done).

